  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_st-tbc product-specification-table-small-padding\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Product Specifications</h2>\n<div class=\"pct_tbc\">\n<table class=\"pct_tb\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\"><!-- 表头 -->\n<thead class=\"pct_th\">\n<tr style=\"height: 39.2045px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold; text-align: center;\">\n<div>Product ID</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>Cable Length</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>Fit for Light Size</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>Material</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"background-color: #c7c7c7; color: #333333; border-color: #ADADAD; font-weight: bold;\">\n<div>Quantity</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"pct_tr\" style=\"height: 19.6023px;\">\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD; text-align: center;\">XC002</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">327mm</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">2pin/8mm</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">Plastic</td>\n<td class=\"pct_td\" style=\"border-color: #ADADAD;\">2 pcs</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Instruction</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<ul style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; row-gap: 10px; column-gap: 50px;\">\n<li>\n<p>USB-A to 2 Pin 8mm Solderless Quick Connector fits <a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/6500k-white-led-light-strip\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><strong>6500K White LED Light Strip,</strong></span></a> a perfect DIY led light accessory kit.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Consideration</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<ul style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; row-gap: 10px; column-gap: 50px;\">\n<li>\n<p>The red wire is connected to the positive pole, and the black wire is connected to the negative pole. Make sure of the correct connection of the \"+\" and \"-\" marks on the connector before powering on.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_padding-in-mobile\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Product Feature</h2>\n<h2 class=\"pct_st\"></h2>\n<ul class=\"pct_productFeatureList\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; row-gap: 10px; column-gap: 50px;\">\n<li>\n<p>Quick connect, solderless, easy to install</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Easy to DIY as a led light accessory kit</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Good flexibility, easy to bend</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "description_text": "USB-A to 2 Pin 8mm Solderless Quick Connector fits 6500K White LED Light Strip, a perfect DIY led light accessory kit.\n\nThe red wire is connected to the positive pole, and the black wire is connected to the negative pole. Make sure of the correct connection of the \"+\" and \"-\" marks on the connector before powering on.\n\nQuick connect, solderless, easy to install\n\nEasy to DIY as a led light accessory kit\n\nGood flexibility, easy to bend",
